{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_gdglow_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_gdglow_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"纯属意外","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_gdglow_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"ba69d2e6d346d3a7f147b2a242a4f42b0c4913104d085f07fe70bf93b6a44360","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G7_decisivebattlealley_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼~哼哼♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天花板夜空投影灯给夏栎姐，信箱上的风铃给风丸小姐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还差格拉尼小姐的、夜烟小姐的、天火小姐的......还有博士、阿米娅、凯尔希医生......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一会儿就该去看看卡拉顿的工友们了。难得回一趟卡拉顿，不知道大家现在过得怎么样了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有这张奖券。上面说最小的四等奖也有二十镑，中奖概率有百分之八十......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们也真是的，非得到现场领奖不可。要不是我这次回卡拉顿看大家，就和二十镑失之交臂了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，那边的高级冰淇淋店是不是在促销？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（咽口水）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我应该不会那么倒霉吧？等拿到二十镑，就吃一球，就一球，尝尝味道就好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先刮开看看吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二十......有了。后面还有零？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二百......两千......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"两万？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一等奖，两万镑？！"},{"type":"narration","text":"苏茜揉了揉眼睛，把奖券对着阳光看了又看。\n刮开的部分清晰无误地写着“一等奖：两万镑”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天啊，这——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（压低声音）不不不不不不，我得冷静，冷静......这么一大笔钱，就、就这么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我马上回办事处找苦根先生，我们一起去兑奖处，马上就去。"},{"type":"narration","text":"尽管心里想的是罗德岛办事处，可不知不觉之间，双脚已经把她带到了冰淇淋店门前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰淇淋店店员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您好，本店今天优惠大酬宾，一球八折，两球五折！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那要是买两球的话......我可以选两个口味吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰淇淋店店员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"当然可以！如果您想尝试更多口味，我推荐更加划算的十色桶......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G9_rhodes_xqoffice"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦根","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"不行了，我也吃到头痛了。这十色桶真够大的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦根","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，都确认是真的了，你就别翻来覆去看那张奖券啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦根","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"正好洗发水厂说他们财务下个月才回来，得到那时候再兑奖，你趁这段时间好好规划下这笔钱该怎么花。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首先把一半寄回家，一万镑应该足够家里换一个更大更漂亮的房子了，剩下的钱可以用来做点生意......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然后，呃......给罗德岛买一大堆理发设备？就连给斑点先生理发也能在十分钟内解决战斗的那种？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦根","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"——噗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦根","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"还是多想想自己的生活吧。一万镑对一家公司来说不多，对一个人来说，足够让生活天翻地覆了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦根","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，车队到了啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦根","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"苏茜，忘了跟你说，我马上要出差一段时间，差不多也是下个月回来，到时候我们一起去把奖领了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦根","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"你接下来去哪？车队说不定能捎你一程。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想去看看吉姆斯先生他们......或许，找家酒吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦根","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"倒是没问题，不过自从“绿意火花”出事之后，感染者社区的工人们就没酒吧可去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦根","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"听说外面有些酒吧会额外收钱偷偷放他们进去，我猜你这一回来，他们多半要拉你一起去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦根","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"小心别暴露了，之前就有感染者暴露了身份，结果被里面的醉汉打了一顿的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我会让大家小心的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bar_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人吉姆斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毕恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者阿石","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"......苏茜，你再说一遍，多少？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）两万镑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者阿石","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"两万镑？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人吉姆斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"小声！你还嫌小火花身上乱子不够多吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者阿石","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）怪我怪我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人吉姆斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）还是别在这儿聊这个了，太危险了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说起来，不是在我走之前就出台了改善感染者工人待遇的法案吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毕恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"法案是好的，可有些东西法案也改变不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毕恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算有法案，我们喝酒不也得偷偷摸摸，跟做贼一样吗——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，对不起，我不是故意要——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毕恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"苏茜，你等等，这人手里是什么......刀片？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可疑的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"*维多利亚粗口*，一身静电的怪物！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒保","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"实在不好意思，我们已经派人去追刚刚那家伙了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒保","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"我们送各位每人一杯特调，千万不要因为那家伙对我们酒吧产生什么坏印象......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毕恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你——等会儿，我认出你来了，就数你找来喝酒的感染者要钱要得最黑，上次不是还因为我钱不够——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒保","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"这是什么话！您没必要这么开玩笑，您怎么可能是感染者......"},{"type":"narration","text":"没人听酒保解释，可也没人像平时那样对感染者避之不及。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"窃窃私语的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"两万？真的假的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"窃窃私语的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这不是撞破了贝希曼议员阴谋的那个苏茜·格里特吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"窃窃私语的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我有个远房亲戚前些天买终端中了二十万呢！听说第二天就把工作辞了，去汐斯塔度假去了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"窃窃私语的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"要不这小姑娘为什么专门搞了静电装置保护自己的钱包？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"窃窃私语的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘁，明明是个感染者，运气倒好，这钱要是给我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人吉姆斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"我们......赶快走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人吉姆斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"快走！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G9_rhodes_xqoffice"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼啊，天亮了。昨晚做了好多噩梦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奖券......还在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对啊，酒吧里的一时失言，没人会当回事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还有好多时间慢慢想这些钱该怎么花......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"信使","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"苏茜小姐，罗德岛的苏茜·格里特小姐在吗？你的信我放在信箱里了，请注意查收。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"信？给我的？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"信使已经走了啊。让我看看......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呀！信箱里怎么一下子塞了这么多信？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而且......都是给我的？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“投资快讯：还在为大额资金难以打理烦恼吗？高多汀公爵亲自认证，维多利亚投资大师......”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“苏茜小姐，我和您一样来自博森德尔，小时候还抱过您。您可能不记得我了......”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“格里特小姐，请帮帮我们。我们在沸区投资的商店连年亏损，现在只需要一笔资金入股......”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不记得自己这么有名啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“致城市英雄苏茜·格里特小姐......欣闻格里特小姐回城，鄙人敬仰见义勇为之热心人士，想请格里特小姐赴寒舍一聚......”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么会这样......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，只要我不上当就没什么好怕的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不能让这笔钱把我回卡拉顿的整个行程都搅黄了！我得振作起来，还有好多朋友没见，还有好多礼物没挑呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——等等，得先把兑奖券锁到更安全的地方。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G7_decisivebattlealley_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，出门就已经中午了啊......送格拉尼小姐什么比较好呢？武器保养油？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱干净的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_701_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是苏茜·格里特小姐吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱干净的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_701_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您不用这么戒备，我曾经在“绿意火花”和您有过一面之缘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是一家感染者酒吧。您真的去过吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......就这个吧。格拉尼小姐一定会高兴的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自来熟的女人","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"苏茜，一定是苏茜吧！快来快来，我可见到你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......认识您吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自来熟的女人","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系，感情可以慢慢培养。要喝点什么吗？我请。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哭丧着脸的路人","speakerId":"avg_npc_729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行行好，我家有四个孩子，我昨天被工厂踢了出来，我什么都没有了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是五镑，你拿好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是赶快回办事处吧，好像又有人要过来了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G9_rhodes_xqoffice"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"锁有被人动过的痕迹？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"糟了，里面都是罗德岛的药啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......还好，没人进来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"得把门关严！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁？别、别进来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毕恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"苏茜，是我，毕恩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕恩先生？你也是来......借钱的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毕恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（尴尬地清嗓子）我不是这个意思......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毕恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"苏茜，不好意思啊，我替阿石给你道歉，我们给你添了大麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，没什么，你们也不是故意的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毕恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我来找你，其实是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毕恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......想找你商量个事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毕恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个，既然你现在宽裕了，我们想着......能不能在原址上重建“绿意火花”......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毕恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，本来也不是我们的钱，我们不该有这种非分之想的。你好好休息吧。苦根呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......出差了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毕恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他快点回来吧。你一个小姑娘突然担了这么大的事——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毕恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，现在说这话还有什么意思呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕恩先生，重建“绿意火花”要多少钱？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毕恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸......欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毕恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我算算，地皮还在，不用额外交钱，给市政厅交一百镑就可以开工。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毕恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样一来，连重建带装修，大概......一千五六百镑吧，加上给市政厅的钱，再算上些零零碎碎的，两千镑就到头了，不会比这更多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毕恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"苏茜，你看......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那就建吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毕恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真、真的？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然是真的。我在罗德岛上过得挺好，不如在生活被这笔钱搅得天翻地覆之前拿它来帮助大家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毕恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“这笔钱”？不，怎么可能用那么多？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事。你也看见外面的信箱了吧？总比和那些来路不明的家伙打交道强多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毕恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我去跟大家说了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！快去吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G9_rhodes_xqoffice"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"苦根先生！你回来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦根","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"事情我听说了，没想到我走了半个月，事情就变成了这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么能叫“变成了这样”呢？我觉得这样很好啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吉姆斯先生现在每天都来跟我汇报进度，酒馆这几天应该快建好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦根","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......两千镑，毕恩报的倒是实价，甚至还把价格往下压了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再多现在也没有了。奖金还没拿到手，我手头只有这两千镑，真的就只是重建“绿意火花”的成本，里面连一个便士的工钱都没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦根","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"工钱啊......我记得毕恩最后也没和你提工钱到底怎么算。这样真的好吗？你给自己的一万镑里可能有一大笔要拿出来，剩不了太多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事的，大家也都是因为生活太苦了，实在没有办法。就算不重建“绿意火花”，我也应该用别的方式帮帮他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管是毕恩先生还是吉姆斯先生都不好意思跟我谈工钱，但这本来就是大家应得的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦根","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"你自己能想得通，那就最好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦根","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，你这边的房子都快建好了，洗发水厂那边的财务是不是也该度完假回来了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_undergroundF"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"财务","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，您是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦根","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"我们来领奖。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"财务","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，原来是苏茜的朋友啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"财务","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看你们这么开心，肯定是中了笔大的对不对？真羡慕你们啊，就算是二等奖，两千镑也能买好多想买的东西了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"两千镑？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"财务","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对啊，两千镑——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦根","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"女士，你说的话和奖券上刮出来的数字可差太多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"财务","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？上面写的多少？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦根","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"一等奖，两万。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"财务","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一等奖？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"财务","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看看......对，你拿着就行，我确认一下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"财务","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是真的没错，这就怪了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厂长","speakerId":"avg_npc_1256_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么回事？谁在门口吵吵闹闹的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"财务","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"厂长，这位小姐抽中了我们的一等奖，可我记得一等奖不是在我休假前就兑出去了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厂长","speakerId":"avg_npc_1256_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？给我看看？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厂长","speakerId":"avg_npc_1256_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这、这这......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"财务","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前兑的奖券在这里......为什么两张奖券的编号一模一样？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厂长","speakerId":"avg_npc_1256_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......肯定是造假！快，快去报警，把这两个骗子抓起来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦根","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，你这是什么意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"财务","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对呀，苏茜小姐是个踏踏实实的人，之前还当了“城市英雄”，她怎么会做这种事？"},{"type":"narration","text":"两边剑拔弩张，眼看就要争执起来，然而在这之前，苏茜先开了口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么会这样......为什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这下连毕恩先生他们的工钱都要付不起了......"},{"type":"narration","text":"苏茜并没有哭，但她无助的喃喃声比哭声更令人揪心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G7_decisivebattlealley_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毕恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哟，苦根，还有苏茜！你们来得正好——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦根","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"毕恩，有件事我得跟你们说一下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毕恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有什么事能比我们手头的事还大？重建现在就差最后一步——把“绿意火花”的招牌重新挂上去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毕恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"苏茜，要不你来挂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦根","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"苏茜......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不、不了......我不能......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毕恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么突然这么消沉，想起伤心事了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是，我、我没事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毕恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我去挂了！这可是殊荣，大家都抢着要干呢。"},{"type":"narration","text":"苏茜跟着毕恩，一路走到“绿意火花”门前。\n小店整体上复原了失火前的花草灯艺店。在原有的格局之外，酒吧里还专门开辟了一个角落，摆放着镜子、转椅和种种理发用品。\n门脸上的烫金字闪闪发光，整个建筑都散发着刚刚装修完毕的独特香气。\n毕恩爬上梯子，小心翼翼地把“绿意火花”的招牌挂好，四周爆发出掌声和欢呼声。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毕恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这下我们终于不用再去外面的酒吧受人白眼了！“绿意火花”万岁！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者区工人们","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"万岁！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"苏茜打量着重新建成的花草灯艺店，兼酒吧，兼理发店。\n它明明应该是自己新生活的开始。\n要不然，它也应该是更多人生活的助力。\n可为什么，为什么总是这样？\n听着身旁人群的欢呼，她鼻子忽然一酸，眼前原本清晰的景象一下子模糊起来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毕恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"苏茜，大家都知道你在这个地方有些不好的回忆，可......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜呜呜......哇啊啊啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者阿石","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"不对，哭得越来越伤心了......这到底怎么回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奖券......厂长说是假的，明明就不是......明明应该有两万镑的，我的积蓄，大家的生活......呜呜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人吉姆斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"奖券？假的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人吉姆斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"苦根，我听你刚刚也跟毕恩说有事，到底怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦根","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"洗发水厂不给苏茜兑奖。他们说一等奖已经被人领走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毕恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有这事？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦根","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"很显然是那个厂长伪造奖券内定了获奖人选，忘了做足准备，结果出了岔子。可他们现在咬死说是印刷错误，不愿意给苏茜付钱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者阿石","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"他们还真敢？“前途”洗发水厂不就在感染者区南边吗？苏茜一开始买他们家的洗发水，不也是因为他们说会支持感染者区吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者阿石","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"他们厂长原来就是这么个支持法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者阿石","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"走，我们讨个说法去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者区工人们","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦根","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，大家有不少是感染者，就这么去工厂，是不是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人吉姆斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"怕什么，不是还有我们吗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人吉姆斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"而且我们又不闹事，我们就跟那个厂长说一声，要是连张奖券都兑不出来，就没人再买他们的洗发水，也没人再给他上工了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人吉姆斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"当时卡拉顿不是还给苏茜发了个“城市英雄”的奖吗，他们就这么对他们封的英雄？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人吉姆斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"苏茜，别伤心了，走，我们一起过去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市政厅官员","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"我们再次向苏茜·格里特小姐，还有关心格里特小姐的人道歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市政厅官员","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"这件事确实令人生疑，但谁也没有确凿的证据来证明厂长暗箱操作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市政厅官员","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"他同意补偿格里特小姐两千维镑，还有两车“前途”牌洗发水。此事到此为止，也请各位不要再节外生枝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人吉姆斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"你等等，这事还——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者区工人们","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者阿石","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，*维多利亚粗口*，说白了还是不拿我们感染者区的人当人看。要是哪个议员老爷身上出了这种事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毕恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，再说也没用的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毕恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管怎么样，至少比什么都没有强多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人吉姆斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"这是我们之前欠你的酒钱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者阿石","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"那......这件事终于办完，我们就先回去了。抱歉啊苏茜，给你添了麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毕恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以后有什么事记得叫我们来帮忙啊！我先走了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸......欸？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吉姆斯先生、阿石哥、毕恩先生——大家先等等！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人吉姆斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？怎么啦，还有什么事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个，大家的工钱......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人吉姆斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"工钱？毕恩说他那天找你的时候都和你聊完了呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是说，我本来应该从两万镑里拿出一大部分作为工钱发给大家的，大家可以用这些钱改善生活，不用再过得那么捉襟见肘......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在只有两千镑了，我实在也拿不出更多钱，只能先把这两千镑分给大家......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人吉姆斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"不对，不对不对不对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人吉姆斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"毕恩，你那天怎么跟苏茜说的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毕恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，那个，苏茜说，“不如在生活被这笔钱搅得天翻地覆之前拿它来帮助大家”，我就说“怎么可能用那么多”......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人吉姆斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"就没了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毕恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就......没了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人吉姆斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"毕恩，你这个混球，怎么连个话都带不明白！这不就变成让苏茜看着给的意思了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人吉姆斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"重建“绿意火花”不是苏茜起的头，但钱可都是她出的！就这你也好意思提“工钱”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毕恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对啊，我怎么可能好意思提工钱？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者阿石","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"你还嘴硬！你看看这事办成了什么样！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毕恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，我错了，我错了，我给苏茜道歉，也给大家道歉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者阿石","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"道歉哪够，至少得给“绿意火花”打一个月白工！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者区工人们","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就是！就是！"},{"type":"narration","text":"感染者区的工人们半真半假地闹作一团。\n苦根看向苏茜，刚刚还写在她脸上的难过和歉疚并未完全散去，但更多的已经是快乐和温暖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家等下，我还是觉得——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人吉姆斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"苏茜，这回大家可不听你的。要是你还想给我们钱，我们可要把你和毕恩打成同党了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不对，再怎么说也不能让大家打白工——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦根","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"苏茜。现在就先把这件事放放吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那，吉姆斯先生，能不能麻烦你把转椅、镜子和理发工具搬出来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人吉姆斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"倒是可以......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么多洗发水根本就运不走，不如在这里帮大家好好理理发！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再说我看你们乱蓬蓬的脑袋不顺眼好久了！毕恩先生，打白工就算了，接下来你给我老老实实坐在这里，听见了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者毕恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者区工人们","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这不是太便宜了这小子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们也别觉得自己逃得掉！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
